I'm now focused on adjusting the parameters within my GLSL code. Specifically, I'm experimenting with the multiplication factors applied to the `length` and `atan` outputs, alongside fine-tuning the `iTime` influence to control the speed and intensity of the tunnel effect's expansion and rotation.

